Subject: [PATCH 059/159] ASoC: codec duplicated callback function goes to component on ak5386
Date: Mon, 8 Aug 2016 09:05:56 +0000
Message-ID: <87k2fr63j8.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
References: <87wpjr8xld.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
